[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-how-to-apply-on-nddc-scholarship-application-portal-2026-step-by-step-guide--97":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},97,"how-to-apply-on-nddc-scholarship-application-portal-2026-step-by-step-guide--97","How To Apply On Nddc Scholarship Application Portal 2026 (step-by-step Guide)","\u003Cp>The Niger Delta Development Commission (NDDC) annually offers fully funded scholarships for students from its region to pursue postgraduate studies in tertiary institutions located in Nigeria and overseas.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>How To Apply on NDDC Scholarship Application Portal 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To successfully apply for the NDDC Scholarship 2026, intending candidates are to first be aware of the scholarship requirements;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>NDDC Postgraduate Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The NDDC Postgraduate Scholarship requires that candidates;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>are from Niger Delta origin particularly from Abia, Akwa Ibom, Bayelsa, Cross River, Delta, Edo, Imo, Ondo, and Rivers State.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have obtained a bachelor’s degree from a recognized tertiary institution in Nigeria \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have graduated with at least a Second-Class Upper grade\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>are not older than 40 years old\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Once you have met the criteria mentioned above, you are eligible to proceed to the application dashboard to begin the application process for the NDDC Dcholarship 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>NDDC Scholarship Application Portal Login\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your application will be submitted via the online NDDC Foreign Scholarship \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarship.nddc.gov.ng\u002Flogin\">application portal\u003C\u002Fa> (\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarship.nddc.gov.ng\u002Flogin\">CLICK HERE\u003C\u002Fa>)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Once you have landed on the page, click “Sign Up” if you are a new applicant or “Login” if you already have an account with the NDDC.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will need to provide your personal details to register an account on the NDDC Postgraduate Scholarship portal.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Once your account is registered, you will receive an email in your inbox or spam folder to activate your account. After this, you will be redirected to the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarship.nddc.gov.ng\u002Fdashboard\">applicants’ dashboard\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>NDDC Scholarship 2026 Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>On the applicant’s dashboard, you are to proceed to fill out the scholarship application forms. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Postgraduate scholarship database\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The NNDC Postgraduate Scholarship application portal is divided into five sections. There are five (5) application forms to be filled out by applicants for the NDDC Scholarship 2026, namely;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Personal Information Form\u003C\u002Fstrong>:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your name, date of birth, address, state of origin, local government, telephone contact, and gender details.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>On this page, you will upload your Birth Certificate, Government Identity Document, Local Government Identification Letter, and Passport Photograph.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>First Degree Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Here, the details of your institution, your degree, discipline, and country will be filled out.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will also need to upload your NYSC Certificate and First Degree Certificate. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Proposed Master’s Program Details:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The name of the foreign institution, the host country, the program, and the nature of your admission.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Before you leave this page, you will upload your Admission Letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Guarantor’s Information\u003Cbr \u002F>5. Application and Confirmation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Proposed Master’s Program Details:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The name of the foreign institution, the host country, the program, and the nature of your admission.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Before you leave this page, you will upload your Admission Letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>High school scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Guarantor’s Information: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Provide the personal details of a recommender\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upload your guarantor letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Application and Confirmation\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Before you submit your application, you will be shown all the details you have entered to check for the correct details.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.nddc.gov.ng\u002FWhatWeDo\u002FScholarship\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.nddc.gov.ng\u002FWhatWeDo\u002FScholarship\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-25 09:48:20",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fhow-to-apply-on-nddc-scholarship-application-portal-2026-step-by-step-guide\u002F69c3a154599846.87956645_screenshot 2026-03-25 093155.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fhow-to-apply-on-nddc-scholarship-application-portal-2026-step-by-step-guide\u002F69c3a154599846.87956645_screenshot%202026-03-25%20093155.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":48},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":45,"oldFileName":45,"type":18,"file":19,"url":46},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-g